        1   DEFINE BUFFER X_chk-doc FOR ub.chk-doc.
        2   DEFINE BUFFER X_chk-gds FOR ub.chk-gds.
        3   DEFINE BUFFER X_inkas FOR ub.inkas.
        4   define input parameter parparentproc as widget-handle no-undo .
